## Model card

- **Name:** Sonus (Qoder)
- **Short description:** Qoder's built-in proprietary agent model (announced 2026-09-10) for long autonomous tasks, knowledge work, coding, and Computer Use inside the Qoder product family. Not a public API SKU; no independent weights or OpenRouter route found.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder model picker only: Qoder, Qoder IDE, Qoder CLI, JetBrains plugin, QoderWake, and Cloud Agents. Announced with Qoder Desktop 0.2.3 Computer Use. No OpenAI-compatible public model ID; no OpenCode Zen ID found.
- **Release / knowledge:** Forum announcement 2026-09-10. Knowledge cutoff **not announced**.
- **IDs:** Display name **Sonus** in Qoder. No `opencode/` or `provider/model` API ID published. Distinct from sibling built-in **Cantus**.
- **Context window:** **no verified public token limit found** (marketing says long/marathon tasks and Qoder long-context/memory; no number on the announcement or credit-factor docs).
- **Modalities:** Computer Use (screen, cursor, keyboard, desktop/pro software) plus coding/agent tool use inside Qoder. Native image/audio/video I/O for the model itself is **not specified** on the announcement. Text out via the Qoder agent UI.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-28):** Credit-metered inside Qoder, not $/1M. Launch reference factor **3.2x** (2026-09-10); updated to **8x** at 00:00 Singapore 2026-09-21 (highest listed built-in factor). Individual plans: Free (limited); Lite $10/mo 1,000 credits; Pro $20/mo 2,000; Pro+ $60/mo 6,000; Ultra $200/mo 20,000. Credit packs $20 / 1,500 credits. Plan credits do not roll over. No per-token list price.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameter count, MoE vs dense, and license **not disclosed**. Third-party blogs that analogize it to GPT-6 Astra / GLM-5.3-Flash are not vendor IDs.

